    "description": {
      "value": "Creating all sorts of minor inventions scratches your itch for problem-solving. Your engineering skills take a particularly creative bent, and no one knows what you'll come up with next. It might be a genius device with tremendous potential or it might explode.\n\nChoose two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Intelligence, and one is a free attribute boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Crafting skill and the Engineering Lore skill. You gain the Specialty Crafting skill feat."
